
Contents of "cnet:mail/temp/"

    - There should be three directories inside this directory:

        outbound/       inbound/        netmail/

    - The main polling script will copy the contents of the REAL directories
      by these names into these temp directories BEFORE deleting the files
      during a poll process. In the event something goes wrong with your
      poll, you'll have these files to go back to.

